      </span></span></span><![endif]>Skills (defense, spell <span class=SpellE>casting,etc</span>)</p>
      <p><b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'>How does this work?<o:p></o:p></b></p>
      <p style='margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo3;
      tab-stops:list .5in'><![if !supportLists]><span style='font-family:Symbol;
      mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol'><span
      style='mso-list:Ignore'>·<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>       
      </span></span></span><![endif]>Available only on <span class=SpellE>Stormhammer</span>.
