      to pay a subscription fee of 39.99 a month. This transfer includes all
      items and anything that is on your character and allows you to move back
      to your original server whenever you want, free of charge.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
      <p style='text-align:justify;line-height:11.25pt'><span style='font-size:
      9.0pt;font-family:Arial'>I started out as a part time power leveling
